    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateAuthoritativeStateOwnerRestart@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic restart of the authenticated Quack state owner against the PCPR-061 DatasetsContextPack@1 identity, the PCPR-062 Kit current root, the PCPR-063 route CID baguqeerab6vsy7orm6wmxmqbzqh5f57dasnufhgngvh47gw7g3whrkr5smga, the PCPR-064 patch CID baguqeeraphkktpgmcw2uusnbxlh7wfjblmhzb4oy3u55bbpdsvbt4xwvvb4q, the PCPR-065 run CID baguqeerazgo2lirhy7hrpa42j227gdpzmi3jl4jdajoz6jzqqx7td6fy7dpa, the PCPR-066 change CID baguqeeraowfymvuvscitvjkxn3sak6f4a2ctkfvflney26jen7gwyqplln6a, the PCPR-067 reuse CID baguqeera75dkjwczh6mehnwyqot25rbd2mazkgjuvb4lrvkdkuqo7vntieuq, the PCPR-068 interface CID baguqeera3k54j374af37kxdvkfgkjdfdofbdtg3x5vckpsceemy4lyklw3dq, and the PCPR-069 delta CID baguqeerahbxnuho3jdzkwaar6yx4ers7ns3p73mm3ghhgc5mhmn5r2fg3pga. Owner state is reconstructed from durable records, not memory. Duplicate restart effects are rejected. Unexpired leases and the current fence epoch are retained. Stale leases and fences expire. Continuation proceeds without database edits. The owner generation increments from 1 to 2. LogicProviderProtocol@2 is not reminted. DatasetsAuthoritativeStateOwnerRestartBinding@1 and KitAuthoritativeStateOwnerRestartBinding@1 consume restart CID baguqeeratw2evha3sv4ko5km5e5igcjprwfpkse4x2siwa5ldhyu5ugbjyja without reminting pack, current-root, route, patch, run, change, reuse, interface, or delta identities. Live Quack restart, live supervisor application, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-070-operator-live-authoritative-state-owner-restart. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
